		<section name="node">
			<attribute key="id" type="int">73</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">This means we need to write one more if else block. You can write as many if else blocks as you want. There is no limit. This can be done in 2 ways.
Method 1:
if (rank &lt; 1200) {
    // Eligible for ABC
} else {
    if (rank &lt; 2800) {
        // Eligible for ARC
    } else {
        // Eligible for AGC
    }
}

Method 2:
if (rank &lt; 1200) {
    // Eligible for ABC
} else if (rank &lt; 2800) {
    // Eligible for ARC
} else {
    // Eligible for AGC
}

Which of the above methods is correct?</attribute>
