		<section name="node">
			<attribute key="id" type="int">83</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">This assignment demonstrates the concepts of comparison operators and conditional statement.
These are the fundamental building blocks and most programming languages have similar concepts.
As an exercise, use internet and find out about the following in Python and Java. You already know it in Javascript.
1. What are the different comparison operators?
2. What is the conditional statement in that language?
3. Read more about comparison operators in Javascript.</attribute>
